{"title":"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rowena is able to mow <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/2/ca2297526ede0e6c616802ca72adf69c82518f25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of a lawn in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. If she began the job at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/2/1d2dc7cd4301b1376b2806a6e3bb6704c3ddffc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10:00 \\text{ a.m.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" />, and mowed at this same constant rate, when did she finish mowing the entire lawn?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/c/05c86576fbd550caa1ae5e83559530bc6ffca5f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 10:08 \\text { a.m.} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 11:30 \\text{ a.m.} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 10:40 \\text{ a.m.} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 10:25 \\text{ a.m.} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 10:45 \\text { a.m.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"785\" height=\"18\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of minutes that it takes for Rowena to mow <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> whole lawn. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/521f32bdde3443a8ab3df96d73c34538cc4778d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{5} \\times m = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/4/42460eda06bd2ff3ad9e23c5f565d739bc100454.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 18 \\div \\frac{2}{5} = 18 \\times \\frac{5}{2} = 45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"216\" height=\"38\" /> minutes\n</p><p>Since it takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes to mow the lawn, she would have finished <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/2/1d2dc7cd4301b1376b2806a6e3bb6704c3ddffc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10:00 \\text{ a.m.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" /> Thus, she\nfinished at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/6852a600eb87c66fad456ef425e136e0ee265c0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 10:45 \\text { a.m.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"135\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\